@startuml
title watch — algorithm
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Read command and validate arguments;
if (Command syntax valid?) then (yes)
while (More watched paths?) is (yes)
if (Path available in current state?) then (yes)
:Display value;
else (no)
:Display unavailable marker, keep watch;
endif
endwhile (no)
:If list is empty, display none, do not move execution;
else (no)
:Display command error, keep current state;
endif
stop
@enduml
